{"answer_parts": [{"part_id": "progression_options", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00061", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "渐进训练可调整负荷、训练量等变量，并结合个人目标；增加次数与调整负荷是不同任务选择。原则本身不能给出个人下一次的精确重量或保证完成。"}], "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-PROGRESSION", "claim_version": "1.4.0", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00061", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "interpretation": "Explicit user-confirmed bounded target; not a free-text question whitelist; source/population constraints still apply.", "question_contract": {"outcome": "progression_options", "requested_relation": "options", "subject": "resistance_training"}, "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}}
{"answer_parts": [{"part_id": "failure_necessity", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00072", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00076"], "text": "这份健康成人综述认为，训练至瞬时肌肉力竭不是获得力量、肌肥大或功率收益的必要条件；这不等于无需足够努力，也不能推算个人最优余力。"}], "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-FAILURE", "claim_version": "1.4.0", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00072", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00076"]}], "interpretation": "Explicit user-confirmed bounded target; not a free-text question whitelist; source/population constraints still apply.", "question_contract": {"outcome": "failure_necessity", "requested_relation": "necessity", "subject": "resistance_training"}, "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}}
{"answer_parts": [{"part_id": "effort_precision", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00072", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00076"], "text": "原文讨论足够努力及一般RIR建议，同时明确现有证据不足以量化精确RIR或主观用力目标。不能据此给每个人指定精确余力，也不能把其他RPE量表直接换成RIR。"}], "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-RIR", "claim_version": "1.4.0", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00072", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00076"]}], "interpretation": "Explicit user-confirmed bounded target; not a free-text question whitelist; source/population constraints still apply.", "question_contract": {"outcome": "effort_precision", "requested_relation": "precision", "subject": "resistance_training"}, "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}}
{"answer_parts": [{"part_id": "volume", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00071", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "该综述中较高组量与部分力量和肌肥大收益有关，但精确最优组数仍不能确定，额外收益可能递减。讨论组量须结合目标与当前计划，不能由总吨位直接推算肌肉刺激或统一加组。"}], "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-VOLUME", "claim_version": "1.4.0", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00071", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "interpretation": "Explicit user-confirmed bounded target; not a free-text question whitelist; source/population constraints still apply.", "question_contract": {"outcome": "volume", "requested_relation": "options", "subject": "resistance_training"}, "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}}
{"answer_parts": [{"part_id": "rest", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00024", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "该综述的健康成人力量结果未显示所比较短长组间休息的一致差别；这是所纳入方案的群体结果，不能证明休息对所有任务都无效，或给每个人确定最佳间歇。"}], "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-REST", "claim_version": "1.4.0", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00024", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "interpretation": "Explicit user-confirmed bounded target; not a free-text question whitelist; source/population constraints still apply.", "question_contract": {"outcome": "rest", "requested_relation": "options", "subject": "resistance_training"}, "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}}
{"answer_parts": [{"part_id": "health_frequency", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00001"], "text": "HHS第二版成人指南建议每周至少两天进行涉及主要肌群、中等或以上强度的肌力活动；这是总体健康建议，不能当作某个人力量或增肌训练的唯一最优频率。"}], "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-PUBLIC-FREQUENCY", "claim_version": "1.4.0", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2", "source_version_id": "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00001"]}], "interpretation": "Explicit user-confirmed bounded target; not a free-text question whitelist; source/population constraints still apply.", "question_contract": {"outcome": "frequency", "requested_relation": "options", "subject": "resistance_training"}, "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"goal": "public_health", "population": "adults", "time_scale": "weekly"}}
